{"seq":2,"slug":"backfill-strategies","title":"数据回填策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/schema-migration-evolution/patterns/backfill-strategies","wordCount":1799,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据回填策略\">数据回填策略</h1><p>扩展阶段加好新列、开好双写之后，新产生的数据已经在新结构里安家，但历史上那几亿行旧数据对新列还是一片空白。把它们搬过去，就是回填。听起来只是一个 <code>UPDATE</code>，真要在一张每秒被写几千次、有五亿行的活表上跑这个 <code>UPDATE</code>，单条语句会锁住半张表、撑爆 undo、拖垮复制延迟，几分钟内引发线上事故。回填的全部工程难度，都在于「在一张持续高并发写入的大表上，把存量数据安全、可控、可中断恢复地搬完」。本篇是迁移阶段「搬存量」这一半的深入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>安全回填的核心是把一次巨大的写操作切成大量微小的、彼此独立的批次，每批只碰几百到几千行，批与批之间留出喘息，并让整个过程对中断免疫。三条铁律支撑这一切：<strong>分批</strong>（绝不单条语句全表更新）、<strong>限速</strong>（根据系统负载动态调节节奏）、<strong>幂等</strong>（同一行被回填多次结果不变，使得任意中断后可安全重跑）。</p>\n<p>下图展示一个生产级回填循环的控制流，注意它如何把「写一批」与「看一眼系统健康再决定要不要喘口气」交织起来：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[确定回填范围:主键区间] --&gt; B[取下一批:WHERE id BETWEEN lo AND lo+N]&#10;  B --&gt; C[幂等更新:仅填 new_col IS NULL 的行]&#10;  C --&gt; D[记录进度:持久化 lo 游标]&#10;  D --&gt; E{检查系统健康}&#10;  E --&gt;|复制延迟高/负载高| F[退避:加大 sleep]&#10;  E --&gt;|健康| G[正常 sleep 短暂]&#10;  F --&gt; H{还有未处理区间?}&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt;|是| B&#10;  H --&gt;|否| I[回填完成:全表 new_col 已填]\">flowchart TD\n  A[确定回填范围:主键区间] --&gt; B[取下一批:WHERE id BETWEEN lo AND lo+N]\n  B --&gt; C[幂等更新:仅填 new_col IS NULL 的行]\n  C --&gt; D[记录进度:持久化 lo 游标]\n  D --&gt; E{检查系统健康}\n  E --&gt;|复制延迟高/负载高| F[退避:加大 sleep]\n  E --&gt;|健康| G[正常 sleep 短暂]\n  F --&gt; H{还有未处理区间?}\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt;|是| B\n  H --&gt;|否| I[回填完成:全表 new_col 已填]</pre><p>回填的批大小与系统影响存在直接权衡，下表给出经验取舍：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>批太大（如 10 万行/批）</th>\n<th>批太小（如 10 行/批）</th>\n<th>推荐区间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单批锁持有时间</td>\n<td>长，阻塞线上写</td>\n<td>极短</td>\n<td>500–5000 行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复制延迟冲击</td>\n<td>大，从库追不上</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>跟着延迟动态调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总耗时</td>\n<td>短</td>\n<td>长，可能跑数天</td>\n<td>接受较长换稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事务/undo 压力</td>\n<td>高，可能撑爆</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>每批独立小事务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分批-用主键游标而非-offset\">分批：用主键游标而非 OFFSET</h2><p>分批最常见的错误是用 <code>LIMIT ... OFFSET</code>。<code>OFFSET 1000000</code> 会让数据库扫描并丢弃前一百万行才取到目标批，越往后越慢，复杂度退化到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。正确做法是用主键区间游标，让每批都走索引、代价恒定：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 每批：处理一段主键区间，只填尚未回填的行（幂等）&#10;UPDATE users&#10;SET    phone_number = phone&#10;WHERE  id &gt;= :lo AND id &lt; :lo + :batch_size&#10;  AND  phone_number IS NULL;        -- 幂等关键：已填的行跳过\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 每批：处理一段主键区间，只填尚未回填的行（幂等）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    phone_number </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> phone</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :lo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :lo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :batch_size</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  phone_number </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 幂等关键：已填的行跳过</span></span></code></pre></div><p>游标 <code>:lo</code> 在每批结束后持久化到一张进度表或配置里。这样无论进程在哪一批崩溃、被人为中断、还是发布重启，重启后从持久化的 <code>:lo</code> 继续即可，绝不重头再来。设总行数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>、批大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>，则总批次数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil N/B \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span>，每批走主键索引代价稳定，整体复杂度为线性的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，这是 OFFSET 方案做不到的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"限速-让回填给线上让路\">限速：让回填给线上让路</h2><p>回填是后台任务，必须无条件给前台用户请求让路。固定 <code>sleep</code> 是不够的——系统空闲时它白白拖慢，系统繁忙时它又不够温柔。生产级回填用<strong>自适应限速</strong>：每批之后读一个健康信号，据此动态调节下一批前的等待时间。</p>\n<p>最重要的健康信号是<strong>复制延迟</strong>。回填的写入要同步到所有从库，若回填太快，从库追不上，复制延迟飙升，会直接危及读副本与故障切换能力。因此一个标准做法是：测量当前复制延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，设阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L &gt; L_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时暂停回填直到延迟回落。等待时间也可按延迟比例放大，例如令本批后的休眠时间正比于延迟超标程度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{sleep} = t_0 \\cdot \\max\\left(1, \\ \\frac{L}{L_{max}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>复制延迟为什么如此敏感、它如何影响整个高可用拓扑，属于兄弟 hub 的范畴，见<a href=\"../../database-replication-ha/foundations/sync-async-replication\">数据库复制与高可用</a>。除复制延迟外，还可纳入 CPU、活跃连接数、锁等待数等信号，构成多维的退避策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"幂等-让-重跑-成为安全的默认\">幂等：让&quot;重跑&quot;成为安全的默认</h2><p>幂等是回填能容忍中断的根本保障。一个幂等的回填，无论某一行被处理零次、一次还是十次，最终结果都一样。上面 SQL 里的 <code>AND phone_number IS NULL</code> 就是实现幂等的最简手法：已经填过的行不会被再次写入，于是「从头重跑整个回填」也完全安全——它只会跳过所有已填行，找出真正遗漏的。</p>\n<p>幂等的价值在故障场景下才显现。设想回填跑到第 30 万行时进程崩溃，而你不确定那一批到底提交了没有。如果回填不是幂等的（比如它做的是 <code>count = count + 1</code> 这种累加），你将陷入「不敢重跑怕重复加、不敢跳过怕漏掉」的两难。幂等让你无脑选择「重跑这一批」，因为重跑最坏只是无操作。这种「让重试天然安全」的设计思想，与<a href=\"dual-write-shadow\">双写与影子读</a>里处理双写失败、以及<a href=\"../practice/rollback-safety\">回滚与安全网</a>里设计可重入操作，是同一种工程审美。</p>\n<h2 id=\"验证回填完成-再谈切流\">验证回填完成，再谈切流</h2><p>回填没有「跑完就一定对」这回事，必须显式验证。验证手段有两层：其一是<strong>完整性检查</strong>，确认不存在「该填而未填」的行，一条 <code>SELECT count(*) FROM users WHERE phone_number IS NULL AND phone IS NOT NULL</code> 返回 0 才算填全；其二是<strong>一致性检查</strong>，抽样比对新旧两列在历史行上是否真的相等，防止回填逻辑本身有 bug（比如类型转换时丢了精度）。</p>\n<p>只有这两层验证都通过，迁移阶段才允许进入「灰度切读」。这里有一个时序上的细节常被忽略：因为双写从扩展阶段就已开启，回填期间新写入的行其新列本就由双写填好；回填只需负责「双写开启之前就存在的旧行」。把回填范围限定在「双写启用时刻的最大主键以内」，能避免回填与双写互相覆盖、也缩小了回填的工作量。切读之后的影子读校验，则是对回填正确性的又一道独立验证，二者叠加才让人敢把流量真正切过去——这正是为什么<a href=\"expand-contract\">扩展-收缩模式</a>把回填和影子读都安排在迁移阶段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>回填把扩展阶段留下的存量空白补齐，难点在于「在持续高并发写入的大表上安全搬数据」，绝非一条 UPDATE。</li>\n<li>三条铁律：分批（主键游标而非 OFFSET，保持 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）、限速（自适应，复制延迟是首要信号）、幂等（用 IS NULL 守卫，让重跑天然安全）。</li>\n<li>自适应限速按复制延迟动态退避，休眠时间随延迟超标程度放大，给线上和从库让路。</li>\n<li>幂等让任意中断后「重跑这一批」成为最坏即无操作的安全默认。</li>\n<li>回填后必须做完整性与一致性两层验证，且只需覆盖双写开启前的旧行；验证通过才允许灰度切读。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章总纲：<a href=\"expand-contract\">扩展-收缩模式</a> — 回填是其迁移阶段的一半。</li>\n<li>另一半：<a href=\"dual-write-shadow\">双写与影子读</a> — 管增量一致性与切流前校验。</li>\n<li>回填限速与大表迁移在亿行尺度的协同：<a href=\"../online-ddl/large-table-migration\">大表迁移</a>。</li>\n<li>跨库链接：复制延迟为何是回填的核心约束，见<a href=\"../../database-replication-ha/foundations/sync-async-replication\">数据库复制与高可用</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据回填策略","id":"数据回填策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"分批：用主键游标而非 OFFSET","id":"分批-用主键游标而非-offset"},{"level":2,"text":"限速：让回填给线上让路","id":"限速-让回填给线上让路"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等：让\"重跑\"成为安全的默认","id":"幂等-让-重跑-成为安全的默认"},{"level":2,"text":"验证回填完成，再谈切流","id":"验证回填完成-再谈切流"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"扩展-收缩模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/schema-migration-evolution/patterns/expand-contract"},"next":{"title":"双写与影子读","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/schema-migration-evolution/patterns/dual-write-shadow"}}